  "description": "Transport-agnostic networking abstractions for Circle AI.\n      INetworkTransport / ISyncChannel work across HTTP, WebSocket, gRPC, MQTT,\n      TCP, WiFi Direct, BLE GATT, NearLink, Aether mesh, and DTN bundles.\n      Specific transports live in Bhengu.AI.Networking.* sub-packages.",
